  s0: No slip yet
  s1: Slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s2: Slip with the integrator#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s3: Returned by the integrator, notice going out#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s4: Slip with the integrator#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s5: Returned by the integrator, notice not delivered yet#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s6: Received, notice going out#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s7: The server holds nothing of the car#59; the integrator is done with it#59; coordinator waits for an answer
  s8: Received#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told received
  s9: On a train#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told received
  s10: On a train, merged to the base#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told received
  s11: Landed, notice going out#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told received
  s12: Landed#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told landed
  s13: The server holds nothing of the car#59; its train still runs#59; another slip waits at the tower#59; coordinator was told landed
  s14: Slip with the integrator#59; coordinator was told landed
  s15: Received, notice going out#59; coordinator was told landed
  s16: Received#59; coordinator was told received
  s17: On a train, merged to the base#59; coordinator was told received
  s18: Landed, notice going out#59; coordinator was told received
  s19: Landed#59; coordinator was told landed twice
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the coordinator sends the car's slip to the tower
  s1 --> s2: the tower forwards the slip to the integrator
  s2 --> s3: the integrator returns the car
  s2 --> s4: the coordinator sends the same head again
  s3 --> s5: the notice is not delivered at the first send
  s4 --> s6: the integrator sets the car received
  s5 --> s7: the sb server restarts
  s6 --> s8: the coordinator gets the notice
  s8 --> s9: the tower opens a train with the car
  s9 --> s10: the train merges the car to the base
  s10 --> s11: the train sets the car landed
  s11 --> s12: the coordinator gets the notice
  s12 --> s13: the sb server restarts
  s13 --> s14: the tower forwards the slip to the integrator
  s14 --> s15: the integrator sets the car received
  s15 --> s16: the coordinator gets the notice
  s16 --> s17: the tower opens a train with the car
  s17 --> s18: the train sets the car landed
  s18 --> s19: the coordinator gets the notice
